// Known-failing CONF findings (docs/plan/09-roadmap-and-process.md §5.10.2 D3; tools/conformance/README.md).
//
// Each record names a rule, the rework WP that owns the fix (`owner`), the §5.10.4 row that records it
// (`anchor`), why, and the findings it pins: one {path, fingerprint} entry per finding. A fingerprint hashes
// the rule, the file, the message and the finding's trimmed source line (`-fingerprints` prints it), so a
// new finding of the same rule in the same file, or a pinned line that changes, still fails the run.
// helios-conformance reports the pinned findings as "known failing, owned by <WP>" (SARIF: an external
// suppression) and does not fail on them. An entry that matches no finding fails the run, so the rework WP
// that closes a gap removes its entries, the record and the scorecard gap (scorecard.jsonc,
// EXIT-0.conformance) in the same PR. `-strict` ignores this file. Adding a record is a Director decision
// (D3), made in the same round as the rework WP it names.
{
  "known_failing": [
    {
      "rule": "CONF-12", "owner": "WP-0.5r", "anchor": "09 §5.10.4 (b)",
      "reason": "The Windows gate sits in .CRT$XIB, ends with ExitProcess, exports helios_cpu_gate_crt_entry, and has neither /INCLUDE:_tls_used nor helios_cpu_gate_tls_entry. WP-0.5r moves it to .CRT$XLA0 with TerminateProcess(…, 78) and the three exports",
      "findings": [
        {"path": "engine/core/src/platform/win32/cpu_gate_hook.c", "fingerprint": "fe5a30b23865ecba"},   // no /INCLUDE:_tls_used
        {"path": "engine/core/src/platform/win32/cpu_gate_hook.c", "fingerprint": "2b7de110ee0c9187"},   // no /INCLUDE:helios_cpu_gate_tls_entry
        {"path": "engine/core/src/platform/win32/cpu_gate_hook.c", "fingerprint": "fe2731053a37dac3"},   // ExitProcess
        {"path": "engine/core/src/platform/win32/cpu_gate_hook.c", "fingerprint": "fe2731053a37dac3"},   // ExitProcess (second call)
        {"path": "engine/core/src/platform/win32/cpu_gate_hook.c", "fingerprint": "6d072e8abe5acd3a"},   // #pragma section(".CRT$XIB")
        {"path": "engine/core/src/platform/win32/cpu_gate_hook.c", "fingerprint": "a48bfb6e143ed3e7"},   // __declspec(allocate(".CRT$XIB")) (MSVC)
        {"path": "engine/core/src/platform/win32/cpu_gate_hook.c", "fingerprint": "10e5bc1974245f8f"},   // external helios_cpu_gate_crt_entry
        {"path": "engine/core/src/platform/win32/cpu_gate_hook.c", "fingerprint": "34ff752452db202d"}    // section(".CRT$XIB") (MinGW)
